title: file-manager:find
tags: [[GUI command]] [[file-manager panel]]
kind: reference
summary: File manager: jump to an entry by name

Moves the cursor of the [[file-manager panel]] onto an entry named in the command input ([[Jumping to an entry]]). Only the displayed directory is searched — its dot-entries only while they are shown — and a directory is selected, not entered; directories carry a trailing `/` among the candidates.
